# Gettext catalogs are compared byte for byte by `scripts/check_i18n.py`, which regenerates
# them and checks the result against what is committed. Babel always writes LF, so a CRLF
# checkout would make that comparison fail on a clean tree. Pin the line endings rather than
# weaken the check.
*.po   text eol=lf
*.pot  text eol=lf

# Compiled catalogs are binary. Line-ending conversion would corrupt them outright.
*.mo   binary
